<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/providesFractionOfTotalFunding> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/providesFractionOfTotalFunding> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> <http://purl.org/linked-data/registry#statusStable> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/providesFractionOfTotalFunding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "provides fraction of total funding"@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/providesFractionOfTotalFunding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Funding> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/providesFractionOfTotalFunding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Budget> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/providesFractionOfTotalFunding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between funding and a budget, specifying what fraction of the total budget is provided by that source of funding."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/providesFractionOfTotalFunding> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-funding a frapo:Funding ;\n        frapo:providesFractionOfTotalFunding :my-budget .\n\n    :my-budget a frapo:Budget .\n    " .
